<code>assert \forall int i; index < i && i < this.size(); this.get(i) == (\old(this.get(i)) != null ? \old(this.get(i)) : this.get(i));</code>

This assert statement ensures that for every index greater than the specified index and less than the size of the list, the element at that index remains unchanged unless it was initially null.
--------------------
<code>assert \forall int i; index < i && i < \old(this.size()); (\old(this.get(i)) == null || this.get(i) == \old(this.get(i)));</code>
